  "为 Pixiv 下载目录设计的本地图片浏览器": "A local image browser built for Pixiv download folders", "当前是浏览器预览版，使用示例数据": "Browser preview with sample data", "桌面版": "Desktop", "版本 {0}.{1}.{2}": "Version {0}.{1}.{2}", "版本 {0}.{1}": "Version {0}.{1}", "版本 预览": "Preview version",
