  "遇到问题时": "If something goes wrong", "导出诊断信息": "Export diagnostics", "导出…": "Export…", "不包含": "not included",
  "把最近的日志和一份当前状态的摘要打成一个压缩包，反馈问题时附上它，能省掉很多来回询问。": "Packs recent logs and a summary of the current state into one archive. Attach it when reporting a problem to save a lot of back-and-forth. Credentials, passwords, databases and images are",
  "登录凭证、密码、数据库和图片；日志里会有账号名、保存位置的路径和画师名，介意的话发出去之前可以先打开看看。": "; logs do contain account names, storage paths and artist names, so have a look before sending if that matters to you.",
  "软件更新": "App update", "检查更新": "Check for updates", "正在检查…": "Checking…", "这一版的变化": "What's new", "打开发布页面": "Open release page", "重启并更新": "Restart and update", "去更新": "Update",
  "点“重启并更新”后程序会关闭，几秒钟后自动以新版本重新打开。正在进行的下载会在处理完当前文件后停止；你的数据（data 文件夹）不会被改动。": "After Restart and update the app closes and reopens as the new version a few seconds later. Running downloads stop after the current file; your data (the data folder) is not touched.",
