  "收藏与最近查看": "Favorites & recently viewed", "收藏、最近查看、置顶的画师。只存在本机，不导入就没有。": "Favorites, recently viewed and pinned artists. Stored only on this computer; gone unless imported.",
  "评分与自定义标签": "Ratings & custom tags", "你给图片打的星和加的标签。只存在本机，不导入就没有。": "Stars and tags you gave to images. Stored only on this computer; gone unless imported.",
  "选择文件…": "Choose files…", "选择文件夹…": "Choose folder…", "检查": "Check",
  "“检查”看头像文件夹里是不是真的有每位画师的头像、还缺谁的，不访问 Pixiv。“补全”把缺的从 Pixiv 下回来：有地址的直接下，地址失效的由所有账号分着去问。平时检查更新时也会顺带把缺的和换过的头像下回来。": "Check looks at whether the avatars folder really has each artist's avatar and whose are missing, without contacting Pixiv. Fill in downloads the missing ones from Pixiv: directly when the address is known, otherwise all accounts share the lookups. Regular checks also fetch missing and changed avatars along the way.",
  "{0} 位画师里有": "Of {0} artists,", "{0} 位画师都有头像。": "All {0} artists have an avatar.",
  "早期下载的和导入的记录大多没有记文件大小，“待下载大约多大”的估算因此不准。这一项把保存位置里的文件逐个文件夹看一遍，把大小补进数据库。不访问 Pixiv、不改动任何文件；图库在网络共享上时要花几分钟，可以随时停止，已经补上的会保留。": "Records from early downloads and imports mostly lack file sizes, which makes the pending-size estimate inaccurate. This goes through the storage location folder by folder and writes the sizes into the database. Pixiv is not contacted and no file is changed; on a network share it takes a few minutes, can be stopped at any time, and keeps what was already filled in.",
  "把保存位置里已有文件的大小补进数据库。不访问 Pixiv、不改动任何文件，可以随时停止。": "Writes the sizes of existing files in the storage location into the database. Pixiv is not contacted, no file is changed, and you can stop at any time.",
